{"page": 124, "lines": [{"t": "7.7", "x": 279.0, "y": 205.0}, {"t": "7.7. 1", "x": 268.0, "y": 1205.0}, {"t": "7/92", "x": 258.0, "y": 2540.0}, {"t": "DSP-2232 OPERATING MANUAL", "x": 278.0, "y": 126.0}, {"t": "7—14", "x": 1083.0, "y": 2545.0}, {"t": "AMTOR AND NAVTEX OPERATION", "x": 1363.0, "y": 131.0}, {"t": "Simultaneous AMTOR and Packet Operation", "x": 484.0, "y": 208.0}, {"t": "Your DSP—2232 can operate AMTOR on Radio Port 1 and HF or VHF Packet", "x": 483.0, "y": 287.0}, {"t": "on Radio Port 2 at the same time. With this feature you won't miss", "x": 481.0, "y": 326.0}, {"t": "any local Packet activity while operating AMTOR.", "x": 482.0, "y": 366.0}, {"t": "Before the second radio port can be used for packet operation, a", "x": 482.0, "y": 445.0}, {"t": "modem must be loaded that can access the second port. There are two", "x": 479.0, "y": 486.0}, {"t": "types of RTTY /AMTOR modems available. The f irst type is a single", "x": 480.0, "y": 525.0}, {"t": "port modem which disables", "x": 479.0, "y": 566.0}, {"t": "packet operation on radio port 2 .", "x": 1004.0, "y": 567.0}, {"t": "are listed", "x": 479.0, "y": 606.0}, {"t": "MODEM", "x": 580.0, "y": 688.0}, {"t": "MODEM", "x": 579.0, "y": 727.0}, {"t": "MODEM", "x": 579.0, "y": 768.0}, {"t": "MODEM", "x": 579.0, "y": 808.0}, {"t": "below.", "x": 705.0, "y": 607.0}, {"t": "1 AFSK Modem,", "x": 725.0, "y": 687.0}, {"t": "2 AFSK Modem,", "x": 724.0, "y": 727.0}, {"t": "3 AFSK Modem,", "x": 724.0, "y": 767.0}, {"t": "4 AFSK Modem,", "x": 723.0, "y": 808.0}, {"t": "170 Hz shift,", "x": 1025.0, "y": 687.0}, {"t": "170 Hz shift,", "x": 1025.0, "y": 727.0}, {"t": "425 Hz shift,", "x": 1023.0, "y": 768.0}, {"t": "850 Hz shift,", "x": 1023.0, "y": 807.0}, {"t": "Mark=2125 Hz,", "x": 1303.0, "y": 687.0}, {"t": "Mark=1445 Hz,", "x": 1302.0, "y": 727.0}, {"t": "Mark=2125 Hz,", "x": 1302.0, "y": 767.0}, {"t": "Mark=2125 Hz,", "x": 1302.0, "y": 807.0}, {"t": "Space—", "x": 1589.0, "y": 688.0}, {"t": "Space—", "x": 1589.0, "y": 728.0}, {"t": "Space=", "x": 1589.0, "y": 769.0}, {"t": "Space—", "x": 1589.0, "y": 809.0}, {"t": "These", "x": 1709.0, "y": 566.0}, {"t": "-2295 Hz", "x": 1690.0, "y": 686.0}, {"t": "-1275 Hz", "x": 1691.0, "y": 725.0}, {"t": "2550. Hz", "x": 1711.0, "y": 766.0}, {"t": "-2975 Hz", "x": 1691.0, "y": 806.0}, {"t": "The second type of modem is \"Dual Ported\", that is allows for", "x": 475.0, "y": 885.0}, {"t": "RTTY /AMTOR operat ion on radio port 1 and", "x": 475.0, "y": 925.0}, {"t": "packet operation on radio", "x": 1303.0, "y": 925.0}, {"t": "port 2 at the same time. The dual port RTTY modems available in the", "x": 474.0, "y": 965.0}, {"t": "DSP—2232 are listed below.", "x": 474.0, "y": 1007.0}, {"t": "MODEM 30: RTTY/TOR 170 Hz:", "x": 575.0, "y": 1087.0}, {"t": "MODEM 31: RTTY/TOR 170 Hz:", "x": 575.0, "y": 1127.0}, {"t": "Selecting and Load inq Modems", "x": 473.0, "y": 1207.0}, {"t": "2125/2295; p2 Packet 300 bps HF", "x": 1143.0, "y": 1087.0}, {"t": "2125/2295; p2 Packet 1200 bps VHF", "x": 1143.0, "y": 1127.0}, {"t": "The various modems available in the DSP—2232 can be seen with the", "x": 471.0, "y": 1288.0}, {"t": "DIRECT (or y) command. To display all the available modems s imply", "x": 471.0, "y": 1329.0}, {"t": "enter the Command Mode of the DSP—2232 and then type DIR as shown.", "x": 470.0, "y": 1369.0}, {"t": "DIR", "x": 656.0, "y": 1451.0}, {"t": "The DSP—2232 will respond with the following:", "x": 469.0, "y": 1528.0}, {"t": "(920716)", "x": 474.0, "y": 1609.0}, {"t": "1:", "x": 491.0, "y": 1650.0}, {"t": "3:", "x": 490.0, "y": 1691.0}, {"t": "10:", "x": 468.0, "y": 1731.0}, {"t": "12:", "x": 469.0, "y": 1772.0}, {"t": "14:", "x": 468.0, "y": 1813.0}, {"t": "16:", "x": 468.0, "y": 1853.0}, {"t": "18:", "x": 467.0, "y": 1893.0}, {"t": "22:", "x": 466.0, "y": 1933.0}, {"t": "25:", "x": 466.0, "y": 1974.0}, {"t": "30:", "x": 465.0, "y": 2014.0}, {"t": "31:", "x": 465.0, "y": 2055.0}, {"t": "33:", "x": 464.0, "y": 2095.0}, {"t": "35:", "x": 464.0